---
title: "borrowBalanceCurrent (Compound V2: cTokens)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_accrue: accrueInterest()
    q_accrue --> q_check_borrow: check accountBorrows[account].principal == 0
    q_check_borrow --> q_zero: principal is zero
    q_zero --> [*]: return 0
    q_check_borrow --> q_calc: principal > 0
    q_calc --> q_compute: borrowBalance = accountBorrows[account].principal * borrowIndex / accountBorrows[account].interestIndex
    q_compute --> [*]: return borrowBalance

    note right of q_compute
        INV-001: borrowBalance = principal * currentBorrowIndex / accountInterestIndex
        INV-002: borrowBalance >= principal (interest only increases balance)
        INV-003: accrueInterest called first to ensure borrowIndex is current
    end note
